# breakout: the digit keys lay out the blocks of a level, a left or right press launches the ball (up-left or up-right) from the pad, which
# follows the pointer while the ball flies; the ball breaks blocks until it falls past the pad. The program has no quit: the road ends it at
# the last still picture. Pointer into the window, level 2, level 5, then a left launch with the pad held still at x 140 until the ball
# falls, a right launch from x 60 the same way.
move 140 200
wait
key 2
wait
key 5
wait
click 1 140 200
wait
click 3 60 200
